PARITY with web/src/components/ai/AIVehiclePaintPreview.tsx (reproduced, not "fixed"):
  - withAiFeature('vehicle-paint-preview', InnerSection): off => EmptyView (.gated). view.opened deferred past the gate.
  - numericVehicleId = isFinite(vehicleId) ? vehicleId : 0 ; haveInputs/canStart = numericVehicleId > 0.
  - DYNAMIC url: numericVehicleId>0 ? /ai/vehicles/{id}/paint-preview/draft : /ai/vehicles/0/paint-preview/draft.
  - body: {} when no style hint, else { style_hint } with .trim() (dropped when blank). vehicleID is in the URL, never the body.
  - AIFeatureCard: title "Draft a Helix paint preview", description (privacy/propose-only), button "Preview paint color",
    badge "Helix", emptyHint "Open a vehicle detail page to enable Helix." shown only when !canStart.
  - AiOutputPanel branch order (error -> empty+streaming thinking -> prose) + the P4 "never a blank box" friendly empty.
  - i18n keys: vehicles.aiPaintPreview.{title,description,button,badge,noVehicleHint} + helix.* + output/chrome keys.
  - Accessibility: header trait, badge label, Ask-Helix aria-label "Ask Helix · Preview paint color", output a11y label,
    Reduce-Motion-aware thinking dots + skeletons, refresh/retry labels.

